<https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#activity/turnover-2026-09-16> a prov:Activity ;
    rdfs:label "Age-structured fleet turnover under a 2032 new-sales phase-out"@en ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Companion notebook to \"Predicting EV adoption in Wales using Semantic Knowledge Graph\" (manuscript, 2026), Stages 7-9; paper S2.3.5, S3.6, S3.8 (Table 10, Figures 6-7). Values taken from: companion notebook cell outputs: CLEETS_EV_Adoption_Wales_Quarterly.ipynb."@en ;
    dcterms:source "companion notebook cell outputs: CLEETS_EV_Adoption_Wales_Quarterly.ipynb" ;
    rdfs:comment "Stages 7-9 of the companion notebook (paper S2.3.5, S3.6, S3.8, Table 10, Figures 6-7). New non-BEV private registrations decline linearly to zero by 2032 Q4 and all replacement registrations are BEV from 2033 Q1; each LAD's private vehicle stock is held at its latest VEH0105 value; vehicles retire under a Weibull survival curve calibrated on median scrappage age (12, 14 and 16 years; central 14) rather than a constant hazard, and the observed BEV vintages are carried forward cohort by cohort to 2053 Q4. The result is a ceiling, not a forecast: it assumes every new private vehicle from the ban onward is a BEV. Outputs: BEV share at 2045 Q4 and 2053 Q4, residual non-BEV stock, and the first quarter at which 95%, 99% and 99.5% BEV share is reached."@en ;
    prov:endedAtTime "2026-09-16"^^xsd:date ;
    prov:used <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH0105>,
        <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH0132> ;
    cleets:notebookStage "Stages 7-9" ;
    cleets:paperSection "S2.3.5, S3.6, S3.8 (Table 10, Figures 6-7)" .

